{
  "description": "The race garage (game/garage.js, garagescene.js, ui/garage.js) on lab_race in warmup: H opens the bay, the buggy on the turntable with the click targets on its parts, the other types parked in the bays with their prices; buying the Legacy Tank, two tiers of plating, a boost tank tier, an engine tier, tyres and the Force-Push Ram Plate puts each on the model at once; a part's options open in place; the right arrow rolls the hovercraft onto the table for a look; H leaves. Then the race: on the grid H opens it again with the countdown on top; the match started stock (warmup buys are the warmup's) with $800: a click on the engine opens its options, Engine I bought there shows on the buggy; at GO the garage closes by itself and alice drives off",
